selftext:
A few weeks had gone by with me going down the rabbit hole of polishing my game prototype. Which maybe a oxymoron. I made some game mechanics improvements, mainly to make the game more engaging. Also make some visual improvement to make the look more cohesive. Still tons of work to do though, not sure how far I should push this, I have a whole another layer of mechanics in mind. 

&#x200B;

Here is the development url: [TopDog: Silicon Valley Edition](https://topdog-dev.netlify.app/)

&#x200B;

Would mean a lot to me if you could play the actual game and not just rely on my screen recording to criticize.

&#x200B;

Thanks for roasting! Last round produced some very constructive criticism, and if this version is improved, I owed a lot to that.
